  {
    "function_name": "t",
    "kind": "translation",
    "line": 317,
    "section": "tome-orcs/data/chats/destructicus-lead.lua",
    "source": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*Several loyal Orcs are eagerly waiting outside the palace to meet you; one steps forward, handing you a set of keys.  The word 'DESTRUCTICUS' is etched into one.*#WHITE#\nChief @playername@!  The Giants are fleeing, and we intercepted a scout carrying this!  We believe they can be used with...  well, you should see for yourself!  Please, come with us to the mountains just south of Kruk Pride!\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*This sounds important.  You should probably head there right away!*#WHITE#",
    "source_tag": "_t",
    "target": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*数名忠诚的兽人在宫殿外焦急地等待着你；其中一名兽人走上前，交给你一串钥匙，上面写着“毁灭号”。*#WHITE#\n@playername@首领！巨人们在逃跑，我们抓住了一名侦查兵，他身上带着这个！我们认为它是用于……算了，您应该亲自来看看！请跟我们来克鲁克部落南边的山脉！\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*这听起来非常重要，你应该马上过去*#WHITE#",
